{"content_hash": "a74e9e35d3577f1f", "version_id": 954, "article_id": 96, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang resigns after 33 years", "title_zh": "执掌英伟达33年后，黄仁勋突然辞职", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ifanr", "source_url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1689249?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542744095-fcf48d80b0fd?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MTB8fGNlb3xlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk0NTM1MzI4fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Campaign Creators on Unsplash", "author": "Campaign Creators", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@campaign_creators?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-sitting-near-table-with-laptop-computer-qCi_MzVODoU?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(76, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(114, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "04848d0d90e2"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-13", "word_count": 250, "reading_minutes": 1.2, "lead": "Jensen Huang, who built Nvidia into the world's leading AI chip company, has stepped down as CEO. The chief financial officer will run the company while the board searches for a permanent replacement.", "lead_zh": "把英伟达打造成全球领先AI芯片公司的黄仁勋，已辞去CEO一职。公司暂时由首席财务官掌舵，董事会则开始寻找正式接班人。", "preview": "On November 12, Nvidia announced that co-founder Jensen Huang had resigned as CEO, president and board member, effective immediately. Chief ", "preview_zh": "11月12日，英伟达宣布，联合创始人黄仁勋已辞去CEO、总裁及董事职务，即刻生效。首席财务官科莱特·克雷斯将出任临时CEO，董事会则着手寻找正式继任者。这是自1993年黄仁勋与两位伙伴创立公司以来的首次CEO更替。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 937, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/96/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 102.625, "size_bytes": 616752, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 284, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/96/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 105.05, "size_bytes": 631296, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 284, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/96/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/96/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 111.925, "size_bytes": 672480, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 284, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/96/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/96/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 97.225, "size_bytes": 584352, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 284, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/96/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/96/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 103.625, "size_bytes": 622656, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 284, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/96/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@959f3ce/content/data/versions/954.json", "paragraphs": ["On November 12, Nvidia announced that co-founder Jensen Huang had resigned as CEO, president and board member, effective immediately. Chief financial officer Colette Kress will serve as interim CEO while the board looks for a permanent successor. It is the first change of CEO since Huang and two partners founded the company in 1993.", "The decision followed a difficult week. On November 8, the board said it had opened an independent investigation into reports about Huang's private relationships, adding that it still had confidence in him. On November 11, Reuters reported that directors were discussing whether to remove him, and the announcement came one day later.", "Nvidia did not explain why Huang left, and the investigation's findings have not been published. During his 33 years in charge, he led the company from graphics cards for gamers to CUDA software and AI data centres. His black leather jacket and product launches made him one of the few widely known chip executives.", "Kress, 59, joined Nvidia in 2013 and is a familiar face to investors. Ian Buck, who helped build CUDA and now leads AI hardware for large data centres, is seen as a strong internal candidate. Apple's Johny Srouji, Arm CEO Rene Haas and Google Cloud CEO Thomas Kurian have also been mentioned.", "Investors reacted sharply: Nvidia shares fell 12.5% in pre-market trading, to $152.00 from $173.73. The company reports quarterly results on November 17, when the new leadership must show it can keep making the right technical and business decisions."], "paragraphs_zh": ["11月12日，英伟达宣布，联合创始人黄仁勋已辞去CEO、总裁及董事职务，即刻生效。首席财务官科莱特·克雷斯将出任临时CEO，董事会则着手寻找正式继任者。这是自1993年黄仁勋与两位伙伴创立公司以来的首次CEO更替。", "这一决定发生在风波不断的一周之后。11月8日，董事会称已就有关黄仁勋私人关系的报道启动独立调查，并表示仍对他抱有信心。11月11日，路透社报道称董事们正在讨论是否解除其职务，仅一天后公司便正式宣布。", "英伟达没有说明黄仁勋离职的原因，调查结论也未公布。执掌公司33年间，他带领英伟达从游戏显卡厂商发展为CUDA软件和AI数据中心领域的重要企业。标志性的黑色皮衣和产品发布会，让他成为少数广为人知的芯片业高管。", "现年59岁的克雷斯于2013年加入英伟达，是投资者熟悉的面孔。参与打造CUDA、目前负责大型数据中心AI硬件的伊恩·巴克被视为有力的内部人选。苹果的Johny Srouji、Arm CEO Rene Haas和Google Cloud CEO托马斯·库里安也被提及。", "投资者反应强烈：英伟达盘前股价从173.73美元跌至152.00美元，跌幅12.5%。公司将于11月17日公布季度财报，届时新管理层必须证明自己仍能做出正确的技术和商业决策。"], "body": "On November 12, Nvidia announced that co-founder Jensen Huang had resigned as CEO, president and board member, effective immediately. Chief financial officer Colette Kress will serve as interim CEO while the board looks for a permanent successor. It is the first change of CEO since Huang and two partners founded the company in 1993.\n\nThe decision followed a difficult week. On November 8, the board said it had opened an independent investigation into reports about Huang's private relationships, adding that it still had confidence in him. On November 11, Reuters reported that directors were discussing whether to remove him, and the announcement came one day later.\n\nNvidia did not explain why Huang left, and the investigation's findings have not been published. During his 33 years in charge, he led the company from graphics cards for gamers to CUDA software and AI data centres. His black leather jacket and product launches made him one of the few widely known chip executives.\n\nKress, 59, joined Nvidia in 2013 and is a familiar face to investors. Ian Buck, who helped build CUDA and now leads AI hardware for large data centres, is seen as a strong internal candidate. Apple's Johny Srouji, Arm CEO Rene Haas and Google Cloud CEO Thomas Kurian have also been mentioned.\n\nInvestors reacted sharply: Nvidia shares fell 12.5% in pre-market trading, to $152.00 from $173.73. The company reports quarterly results on November 17, when the new leadership must show it can keep making the right technical and business decisions.", "body_zh": "11月12日，英伟达宣布，联合创始人黄仁勋已辞去CEO、总裁及董事职务，即刻生效。首席财务官科莱特·克雷斯将出任临时CEO，董事会则着手寻找正式继任者。这是自1993年黄仁勋与两位伙伴创立公司以来的首次CEO更替。\n\n这一决定发生在风波不断的一周之后。11月8日，董事会称已就有关黄仁勋私人关系的报道启动独立调查，并表示仍对他抱有信心。11月11日，路透社报道称董事们正在讨论是否解除其职务，仅一天后公司便正式宣布。\n\n英伟达没有说明黄仁勋离职的原因，调查结论也未公布。执掌公司33年间，他带领英伟达从游戏显卡厂商发展为CUDA软件和AI数据中心领域的重要企业。标志性的黑色皮衣和产品发布会，让他成为少数广为人知的芯片业高管。\n\n现年59岁的克雷斯于2013年加入英伟达，是投资者熟悉的面孔。参与打造CUDA、目前负责大型数据中心AI硬件的伊恩·巴克被视为有力的内部人选。苹果的Johny Srouji、Arm CEO Rene Haas和Google Cloud CEO托马斯·库里安也被提及。\n\n投资者反应强烈：英伟达盘前股价从173.73美元跌至152.00美元，跌幅12.5%。公司将于11月17日公布季度财报，届时新管理层必须证明自己仍能做出正确的技术和商业决策。", "text": "On November 12, Nvidia announced that co-founder Jensen Huang had resigned as CEO, president and board member, effective immediately. Chief financial officer Colette Kress will serve as interim CEO while the board looks for a permanent successor. It is the first change of CEO since Huang and two partners founded the company in 1993. The decision followed a difficult week. On November 8, the board said it had opened an independent investigation into reports about Huang's private relationships, adding that it still had confidence in him. On November 11, Reuters reported that directors were discussing whether to remove him, and the announcement came one day later. Nvidia did not explain why Huang left, and the investigation's findings have not been published. During his 33 years in charge, he led the company from graphics cards for gamers to CUDA software and AI data centres. His black leather jacket and product launches made him one of the few widely known chip executives. Kress, 59, joined Nvidia in 2013 and is a familiar face to investors. Ian Buck, who helped build CUDA and now leads AI hardware for large data centres, is seen as a strong internal candidate. Apple's Johny Srouji, Arm CEO Rene Haas and Google Cloud CEO Thomas Kurian have also been mentioned. Investors reacted sharply: Nvidia shares fell 12.5% in pre-market trading, to $152.00 from $173.73. The company reports quarterly results on November 17, when the new leadership must show it can keep making the right technical and business decisions.", "vocab": [{"word": "resign", "pos": "verb", "zh": "辞职", "note": "resign as CEO 辞去CEO职务", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "interim", "pos": "adj", "zh": "临时的", "note": "interim CEO 临时首席执行官", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "successor", "pos": "noun", "zh": "继任者", "note": "常与 permanent 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "board", "pos": "noun", "zh": "董事会", "note": "board of directors 的简称", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "effective immediately", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "即刻生效", "note": "公告中常见表达", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "investigation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "调查", "note": "open/launch an investigation 启动调查", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "candidate", "pos": "noun", "zh": "候选人", "note": "internal/external candidate 内部/外部人选", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"wor